cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Macro Builder in published work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Macro Builder: GUI-driven ImageJ macro construction and batch runner"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.21633369"
abstract: >-
  Standalone Fiji/ImageJ plugin for building ImageJ macro (.ijm) filter
  pipelines from a single image, stack, or multi-channel hyperstack.
  Provides a visual builder, macro recorder integration, batch runner
  across folders or Bio-Formats series, threshold shootout tests, and
  exportable batch-count macros.
